WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.422
Earned media is coverage you earn, not buy.

00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:05.568
It needs ambassadors matched to the moment,

00:00:05.618 --> 00:00:07.372
credible people and content,

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:08.587
real news relevance,

00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:10.282
and clear measures.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:13.193
A family watches the evening news.

00:00:13.243 --> 00:00:16.188
A charity worker on the ground explains the crisis.

00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:20.197
Nobody paid for that slot, so they trust it more than an ad.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.645
Rexona couldn't afford cluttered sport sponsorship,

00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:26.451
so it made Pitvertising and got everyone talking.

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:29.074
If you can't buy media, earn it.

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:33.432
UNICEF Australia's news mentions rose two hundred and seventy percent.

00:00:33.482 --> 00:00:35.047
So find a genuine story and the right voice,

00:00:35.097 --> 00:00:38.629
then track your share of voice.
